      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not just the crowds, it's the type of people that hang out there, especially at night. You'll find a lot of young guys from the local council estates, some of them can be a bit rough around the edges, if you know what I mean. There's also a lot of homeless people and addicts in the area, which can make it feel seedy. But, if you're careful and keep your wits about you, it's not necessarily a bad area. Just don't walk around alone at night, especially if you're a solo female tourist. Stick to the day time and explore the high street, it's got a great mix of shops and restaurants.",
